Suppose you have only your weapon and a nymph have stolen all your items. Then
it makes sense to send yourself mail. If you carry junk then the nymph will
steal the wrong item (read the rumors!). This can not be done with iron chains
(from a iron golem). They are too heavy and you can't send them to yourself.

Also scroll of mails are very usefull to read your mail. If you have no fancy
window-system with automatic mail notifiers and you are waiting for mail, then
you can play nethack in the meanwhile.

I could not find any use for the iron chain (except weight). I checked the
spoilerfile, but I couldn't find something. I tried to polymorph it, but
nothing heapens (BTW I expected a chain mail, maybe a wand of manufacturing
should be added, for making a dragon scale mail, a crysknife and a chain mail).

So, this makes the iron chain more useless than the scroll of mail.

